{"seq":3,"slug":"worker-pool","title":"Worker Pool 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/worker-pool","wordCount":668,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"worker-pool-模式\">Worker Pool 模式</h1><p>Worker Pool（工作池）将 Fan-Out 的「每任务一 goroutine」模型改为「固定数量的长生命周期 goroutine 持续消费任务队列」。这种模式在 Go 服务中极为常见：HTTP 服务器后端的请求分发、消息队列的消费者组、批处理系统的并行执行器——本质上都是 Worker Pool 的变体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    JOBS[&quot;任务队列 jobs chan&quot;] --&gt; W1[&quot;Worker 1&quot;]&#10;    JOBS --&gt; W2[&quot;Worker 2&quot;]&#10;    JOBS --&gt; W3[&quot;Worker 3&quot;]&#10;    JOBS --&gt; WN[&quot;Worker N&quot;]&#10;    W1 --&gt; RES[&quot;结果 channel&quot;]&#10;    W2 --&gt; RES&#10;    W3 --&gt; RES&#10;    WN --&gt; RES\">graph LR\n    JOBS[\"任务队列 jobs chan\"] --&gt; W1[\"Worker 1\"]\n    JOBS --&gt; W2[\"Worker 2\"]\n    JOBS --&gt; W3[\"Worker 3\"]\n    JOBS --&gt; WN[\"Worker N\"]\n    W1 --&gt; RES[\"结果 channel\"]\n    W2 --&gt; RES\n    W3 --&gt; RES\n    WN --&gt; RES</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>Fan-Out（按任务启动）</th>\n<th>Worker Pool（固定池）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>goroutine 生命周期</td>\n<td>一任务一 goroutine，完成即退</td>\n<td>长驻，循环消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发度控制</td>\n<td>靠 semaphore 限制</td>\n<td>池大小即并发度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动开销</td>\n<td>每任务 goroutine 创建 + 栈分配</td>\n<td>启动时一次性创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>任务量有限、突发式</td>\n<td>持续流式、高吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存特征</td>\n<td>随任务数波动</td>\n<td>稳定（N × goroutine 栈）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标准实现\">标准实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type Pool struct {&#10;    jobs    chan func()&#10;    quit    chan struct{}&#10;    wg      sync.WaitGroup&#10;}&#10;&#10;func NewPool(size int) *Pool {&#10;    p := &amp;Pool{&#10;        jobs: make(chan func(), size*2),&#10;        quit: make(chan struct{}),&#10;    }&#10;    for i := 0; i &lt; size; i++ {&#10;        p.wg.Add(1)&#10;        go p.worker()&#10;    }&#10;    return p&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (p *Pool) worker() {&#10;    defer p.wg.Done()&#10;    for {&#10;        select {&#10;        case job, ok := &lt;-p.jobs:&#10;            if !ok {&#10;                return&#10;            }&#10;            job()&#10;        case &lt;-p.quit:&#10;            return&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (p *Pool) Submit(job func()) {&#10;    p.jobs &lt;- job&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (p *Pool) Shutdown() {&#10;    close(p.quit)&#10;    p.wg.Wait()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Pool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    jobs    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    quit    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">chan</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    wg      </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WaitGroup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><spa